    AbstractModule <|-- CallCenterModule
    CallCenterParticipant <|-- Client
    CallCenterParticipant <|-- Operator
    CallCenterParticipant <|-- Supervisor
    ConversationScript <|.. StandardConversationScript
    Operator ..> ConversationScript : uses
    Call --> TelephonyService : injected instance
    Call *-- "0..1" CallRecording : owns
    Call --> RecordingStore : constructor-injected abstraction
    RecordingStore <|.. SqliteRecordingStore
    CallCenterModule ..> RecordingStore : binds to SqliteRecordingStore
    CallCenterModule ..> Connection : @Provides @Singleton
    SqliteRecordingStore --> Connection : constructor injection
    Main ..> CallCenterModule : creates
    Main ..> Injector : Guice.createInjector and getInstance
    Main ..> Call : obtains through Injector
    Main ..> Client : creates and submits callback request
    Main ..> Operator : creates and delegates call handling
    Main ..> Supervisor : creates and requests evaluation
    Main ..> TelephonyService : creates
    Main ..> ConversationScript : creates implementation
    Main ..> StandardConversationScript : instantiates
    Main ..> EmailService : creates and sends summary
    Main ..> ConversationSummary : creates
    Main ..> RecordingStore : obtains through Injector
    Main ..> HtmlReportGenerator : uses
    Call "1" --> "0..1" QualityEvaluation : stores
    Call "1" --> "0..1" ConversationSummary : stores
    Client ..> Call : requestCallback(..., injectedCall)
    Operator ..> Call : handleCall(call, script)
    Supervisor ..> Call : evaluate(recording, call)
    Supervisor ..> CallRecording : listens to
    Supervisor ..> QualityEvaluation : creates
    EmailService ..> Client : delivers to
    EmailService ..> ConversationSummary : sends

    note for CallCenterParticipant "getParticipantId() є final; getDisplayName() є abstract"
    note for Call "П'ятиаргументний конструктор позначений @Inject; callId має @Named('callId')."
    note for CallCenterModule "AbstractModule: configure() прив'язує RecordingStore до Singleton SqliteRecordingStore; provideConnection() є @Provides та @Singleton."
    note for SqliteRecordingStore "Конструктор позначений @Inject; Connection надає CallCenterModule."
    note for Client "requestCallback(String, String, Call) використовує переданий Injector-екземпляр; не створює Call."
    note for TelephonyService "Симуляція телефонії; зовнішніх викликів немає"
    note for EmailService "Симуляція електронної пошти; успіх повертається після receiveSummary()"
    note for ConsoleEncoding "Технічна утиліта, не предметна сутність; статично налаштовує UTF-8 для стандартних потоків консолі"
